    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Wave Serpent Shield" hidden="false" id="a901-8992-2626-36ee">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Wave Serpent Shield" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="0320-72c4-c1ff-d0b2">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A model equipped with a Wave Serpent Shield has a 6+ Invulnerable Save against Shooting Attacks made on their Front or Side Armour Facings.


In addition, once per game, the Controlling Player may choose to use the Wave Serpent Shield to make a Shield Blast attack. A Shield Blast is a Shooting Attack with the following Profile, and is counted as a Hull (Front) Mounted weapon:

For the remainder of the battle after the Shield Blast has been resolved, the model that made the Shield Blast attack may not claim the 6+ Invulnerable Save granted by the Wave Serpent Shield.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Shield Blast" typeId="1a1a-e592-2849-a5c0" typeName="Weapon" hidden="false" id="34b9-2919-fc2d-1553">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="95ba-cda7-b831-6066">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="24d9-b8e1-a355-2458">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="f7a6-e0d8-7973-cd8d">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="2f86-c8b4-b3b4-3ff9">Assault 8, Ignores Cover, Concussive (2), One Use</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Concussive (X)" id="d675-e5bd-2783-7b49" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7ce5-1bfb-64e6-f826">
          <modifiers>
