    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Guide Stones" hidden="false" id="6bd6-ddb0-f6ce-59c6">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Guide Stones" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="fce1-74b3-ab2b-b0ce">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Any unit that includes one or more models with the Wraith Unit Sub-type is considered to automatically succeed the Leadership test required by the Wraithsight provision described as part of that Subtype while within 12&quot; of a friendly model equipped with Guide Stones. Note this does allow a unit both equipped with Guide Stones, and possessing the Wraith Unit Sub-type, to automatically succeed its own Leadership test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Psychic Discipline: The Runes of Twilight" hidden="false" id="d2b7-97db-99e3-72ef">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Voice of Twilight (Psychic Power)" typeId="5405-b3c6-e8d0-4e77" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="009c-b7c5-1ccc-39a9">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4c0f-7e2f-586c-9305">Instead of making a Shooting Attack, a Psyker with this Psychic Power may select a single friendly unit with a model within 18” which contains at least one model with the Wraith Sub-Type and apply one of the following effects to all models with the Wraith Sub-Type in the unit. All effects last until the beginning of the Controlling Player’s next turn:


• The unit gains the Precision Shots (5+) Special Rule.
• The unit gains the Precision Strikes (5+) Special Rule.
• The unit gains the Split Fire Special Rule.
• The unit gains the Furious Charge Special Rule.


When using this power, the controlling player may choose to have the Psyker take a Psychic check. If the Check is passed then two different options may be applied to the target unit instead of one. If the Check is failed then no benefits are gained and the Psyker suffers Perils of the Warp.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Executioner (Psychic Weapon)" typeId="cede-0217-1b10-2a34" typeName="Psychic Weapon" hidden="false" id="119e-c638-c03c-b328">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="62ec-fbf5-5252-0d17">18&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="17ff-12e7-77d3-2fbe">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="f431-a7b9-d9d0-36c9">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="2159-62b6-4337-d516">Assault 4, Fleshbane, Deflagrate, Disruption (5+), Precision Shots (5+), Psychic Focus</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Fleshbane" id="4bf9-b571-d5f6-ff36" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="40cd-9505-253c-e76f"/>
        <infoLink name="Deflagrate" id="4d88-5d53-585e-913f" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="60bc-f79a-67ae-be4f"/>
        <infoLink name="Disruption (X)" id="3b96-48cb-39da-1439" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4eb9-9e5e-bb27-3644">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" value="Disruption (5+)" field="name"/>
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
        <infoLink name="Precision Shots (X)" id="672c-3f63-92fe-dc06" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4b71-81ee-31f4-fa09">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" value="Precision Shots (5+)" field="name"/>
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
        <infoLink name="Psychic Focus" id="f16f-5133-d1b2-e82b" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="bff3-3548-b2b8-72f1"/>
      </infoLinks>
